                },
                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2026-10-31T17:05:58Z",
                    "email": "karthik26092005@gmail.com",
                    "name": "G26Karthik"
                },
                "message": "Fix missing .pxd dependency for \"from pkg cimport submodule\" (GH-8091)\n\ndependency_after_from_regex is anchored with \"^\", but it is applied right\nafter the \"cimport\" keyword, so a name on the same line was never matched\nand the search skipped ahead to the next indented line. Match directly at\nthat position instead, so that \"from pkg cimport submodule\" is tracked as\npkg.submodule and parenthesised multi-line imports are read completely.\n\nFixes https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/8091",
